WEBVTT

00:04:58.797 --> 00:05:01.330
There is still so much
beauty in the world.

00:05:01.697 --> 00:05:02.897
So much love.

00:05:03.230 --> 00:05:05.630
I'm hopeful for the next generation.

00:05:06.197 --> 00:05:09.497
For every creature, large and small.

00:05:09.963 --> 00:05:12.697
And for the planet we call home.

00:05:23.997 --> 00:05:27.297
A Love Letter to Storytelling
by Debbie Millman

00:05:28.763 --> 00:05:34.597
"A need to tell and hear stories
is essential to the species Homo Sapiens.